ry x="690" y="792" width="500" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="55" value="Solid open arrows: navigable associations. Multiplicities belong to the two association ends. Filled diamond: owned embeddable image values.&#xa;Generated Lombok accessors/constructors are omitted. Service/User are explicitly partial; other entity fields above are complete.&#xa;ServiceComplaint.status and outcome are String fields. Current status: PENDING / RESOLVED; outcome: null / DISMISS / REMOVE.&#xa;Legacy status values remain readable. Event.action: REQUEST_EXPLANATION / EXPLAINED / DISMISS / REMOVE.&#xa;ModerationLog.targetId is a scalar polymorphic ID, not a JPA association to ServiceComplaint. No cascade-delete guarantee is implied for events.&#xa;Each image value has one owner: complaint XOR event; request validation limits each image list to five.&#xa;UserRole = USER / ROOM_HOST / STAFF / ADMIN; UserStatus = ACTIVE / INACTIVE. MANAGE_SERVICE is a capability, not a role." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1240" width="1820" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="23" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=0;exitX=0;exitY=0.4;entryX=1;entryY=0.3;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#475569;" edge="1" parent="1" source="8" target="3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="0..*" style="edgeLabel;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="23"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-45" y="-20" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="25" value="1" style="edgeLabel;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="23"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="-20" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="27" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.4;e